{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You're just a student who needs cash.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One mistake - and it's over.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/aa5c06328c0d58339f62dfa4c9751f29.poster.avif?t=1772648373\" width=504 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/aa5c06328c0d58339f62dfa4c9751f29.webm?t=1772648373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/aa5c06328c0d58339f62dfa4c9751f29.mp4?t=1772648373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a broke student working at a sketchy 24/7 drive-thru, trying to save up for a car.<br>The pay\u2019s good. The rules are weird. The customers? Even weirder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What do you actually do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take drive-thru orders</strong> from cars that may - or may not - be real</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook and assemble burgers</strong>, fries, and drinks under pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean the restaurant</strong> (wipe tables, mop floors, restock items)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen to new VHS tapes</strong> each night that give updated rules and survival tips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track each car</strong> in a logbook to avoid serving the same one twice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn cash</strong> with every completed shift - save it to reach your goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One mistake = death = restart</strong>. There are no saves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/549930c421b9339ac9285003ec7fbbf7.poster.avif?t=1772648373\" width=504 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/549930c421b9339ac9285003ec7fbbf7.webm?t=1772648373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/549930c421b9339ac9285003ec7fbbf7.mp4?t=1772648373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every shift is different</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night introduces <strong>new rules</strong>, <strong>new customers</strong>, and <strong>new events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The tapes change</strong> - sometimes helpful, sometimes misleading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter <strong>anomalies</strong>, <strong>audio glitches</strong>, <strong>false orders</strong>, and <strong>creatures</strong> pretending to be customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, shifts become more difficult, longer, and more unpredictable </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/c038a9e0ff9cd6016c6c3a2868b31b18.poster.avif?t=1772648373\" width=504 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/c038a9e0ff9cd6016c6c3a2868b31b18.webm?t=1772648373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/c038a9e0ff9cd6016c6c3a2868b31b18.mp4?t=1772648373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you finish your shift, follow the rules, and earn your freedom?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will the restaurant claim one more employee?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4147170?t=1772648373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4147170?t=1772648373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/caaa809e8b585a774c60fda77b276e17b1bde4f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772648373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/caaa809e8b585a774c60fda77b276e17b1bde4f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772648373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You're just a student who needs cash.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One mistake - and it's over.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/aa5c06328c0d58339f62dfa4c9751f29.poster.avif?t=1772648373\" width=504 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/aa5c06328c0d58339f62dfa4c9751f29.webm?t=1772648373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147170/extras/aa5c06328c0d58339f62dfa4c9751f29.mp4?t=1772648373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a broke student working at a sketchy 24/7 drive-thru, trying to save up for a car.<br>The pay\u2019s good. The rules are weird. The customers? Even weirder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What do you actually do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><